OL,3,AToo early to say what motive for
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack was,
OL,5,AIsraeli PM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is too early to say why a pilot
OL,8,Fstabbed another pilot and tried to take
OL,9,Fover a flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv,
OL,10,FIsrael's prime minister has said.
OL,12,FThe Flydubai plane plunged more than
OL,13,F17,000ft (5,200m) two hours into its
OL,14,Fjourney on Wednesday during the
OL,15,Fincident, before passengers and crew
OL,16,Foverpowered the attacker and retook
OL,17,Fcontrol to land safely.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
