OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AToo early to say what motive for
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack was,
OL,5,AIsraeli PM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe stabbed pilot, Indian national
OL,8,FCaptain Smit Machchhar, is now in
OL,9,Fhospital in a stable condition, and has
OL,10,Fbeen hailed a "true hero" by Prime
OL,11,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu.
OL,13,FOne passenger, Yaniv Hayun, described
OL,14,Fhow he put the attacker, who was trying
OL,15,Fto disable the plane, in a chokehold
OL,16,Fbefore other passengers helped pin him
OL,17,Fdown.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
